  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Surendra Kumar vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 6 August, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:126802 Court No. - 5 Case :- Writ - A No. - 11156 of 2024 The violation of the State's Transfer Policy howsoever gross is not a ground for this Court to issue a Surendra Kumar vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 6 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/149451163/ 1 writ.",
    "facts": "He has been transferred vide the impugned transfer order dated 30.06.2024 issued by the Additional Commissioner (Administration) in the Office of the Commissioner, Food Safety and Drugs Administration, Lucknow from Lalitpur to Etawah in public interest. The petitioner has already represented in the matter to the Commissioner, Food Safety and Drugs Administration, U. P., Lucknow vide his representation dated 03.07.2024, which has been duly recommended by the Assistant Commissioner (Food)-II, Food Safety and Drugs Administration, Ballia.",
    "arguments": "Mr. A. K. Pandey, learned Counsel for the petitioner has submitted that the transfer order is in violation of the State's Transfer Policy dated 11.06.2024, inasmuch as, the petitioner's wife is posted as an Assistant Teacher at Lalitpur and the policy is clear that the husband and wife, as far as possible, should be posted at the same station. The other ground is that the petitioner's wife has suffered an accident, on account of which she is bed ridden and requires medical care and attention."
  },
